@startuml
!theme plain
title Product: Search & Filter Sequence

actor "Customer" as Customer
participant "ProductController" as ProdCtrl
participant "ProductService" as ProdService
participant "Product (DB)" as ProdDB

Customer -> ProdCtrl : GET /products?search=...&category=...
activate ProdCtrl

ProdCtrl -> ProdService : getAllProducts(query)
activate ProdService

ProdService -> ProdDB : findMany(where, include: variants)
activate ProdDB
ProdDB --> ProdService : products list
deactivate ProdDB

ProdService --> ProdCtrl : products list
deactivate ProdService

ProdCtrl --> Customer : 200 OK (JSON)
deactivate ProdCtrl

@enduml
